WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:06.200
Fire, and you might learn
what you want to know.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.370
Well? Did I pass?

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.220
I'm sorry.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.620
It was the best I could
think of on the spot.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.430
I'll definitely be staying, Leader.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.550
What was that all about?!

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.880
I suspect he just wanted to know

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:38.420
if we stood a chance against
Team Red under my leadership.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.950
My ability can even block a cannon.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:45.840
That's why I urged him to try it.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.860
Yeah, right...

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.430
You didn't even believe I had the cannon.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.300
Our leader's a crafty man.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.670
Come in.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.580
So sorry to disturb you, Yuuto...

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.240
What is it, Momoko?

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.980
This latest influx appears rather large.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.280
The people just keep pouring in.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.740
A whole band of new recruits...

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.720
They could break us out of our stalemate.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:12.190
But we won't have enough rooms.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:13.820
Yes indeed.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:18.170
You can put Yuuri and me in
the same room if you want.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:58.280
There was a romance series I used
to read at a friend's house.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.610
I really wanted to be in a story like that.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.950
I'd read it, my heart pounding, wondering,
"Could the same thing happen to me some day?"

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.000
I'm staying here with Akira?

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.590
Isn't this...

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.260
What's wrong, Yuuri?

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:28.720
I d-didn't find anything!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.070
Wait, I haven't had a bath!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.030
No, forget that!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.990
This freaking thing in my pocket...

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.030
Thanks a lot.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.120
I'm sorry to make you share a room with me.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.620
But I really wanted to be alone with you.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.790
There's something I really need to tell you.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.670
Wh-What do I do? What do I say?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.210
And how do I even feel about him?!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.590
What I've written here
is very important to me.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.580
Would you please read it?

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.100
Here? Now?

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.180
Yes.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.480
Huh?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.570
Wh-What the heck are you—

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.440
Don't say anything. Just trust me.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.820
Believe that you and I can be of one mind.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.450
This isn't about romance at all!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.830
Why did I have to get ahead of myself?!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.040
You're so stupid!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.000
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.620
Yuuri!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.080
Yuuri...

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.880
Close your eyes, focus, and imagine.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.210
Imagine that my feelings will reach you.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.050
Reach me? Yeah right!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.180
What the heck is Akira even thinking?

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:55.640
But if two people really could be
of one mind, like telepathy...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:00.070
If you really could read someone's
most hidden feelings...

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.400
I want to believe.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.240
Yuuri. Yuuri...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.700
If you can hear me, give me a sign.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.000
You heard me, Yuuri!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.920
What's going on? My head...

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.630
Okay, now try me.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.500
Try to speak into my mind.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.050
Believe that your words will reach me!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.340
Really?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.180
Akira? Akira?

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.430
You did it!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.850
Yuuri, we're connected!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.100
What the—

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.440
From here on out,
let's only talk in our minds.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.150
Please!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.820
This is my real ability.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.360
But I don't want you to say it aloud.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.490
The room might be monitored.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.320
M-Monitored?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.910
Who would be doing that?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.530
Our leader, of course.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.660
So you don't trust him?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.750
No, I expect that because I do<i> trust him.</i>

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.170
He's someone worth counting on.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.710
Keeping this place safe means that
he has to question everything.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:06.170
He'll be keeping a close watch on
us until he knows he can trust us.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.260
On top of that, you and
I have strong abilities.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.680
It's only natural that they'd monitor us.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.220
We've agreed to work together.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.770
And I'll explain about my power later, too.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.480
In the meantime, feel free
to ask me anything you want.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.480
In exchange, I want to learn more about you.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.280
I see...

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.450
So you also have to get back
to help this Riria girl?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.240
Yeah.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:37.200
I think we've been declared
dead on the outside,

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.330
which is probably really painful for her.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.790
And Mom...

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.300
What will your parents think, Akira?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.590
Not sure.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.720
I only have my father,

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.640
but I doubt my disappearance
will bother him much.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.550
That can't be true!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.810
I'm sure they'll be happy
to see us come home.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.100
Your dad... and my mom.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.310
It's fine.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.650
My objective isn't to return home,
but to beat the game.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:07.150
Then I can have a rematch
with that Mion woman.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.700
I'll make her regret giving
me this ability then.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.740
Let's shake, Yuuri.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.740
How come?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:21.210
You've assured me that
I really can trust you.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:25.210
I promise that you will make it home.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.050
I want you to trust me, too.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.970
Will you keep my ability a secret?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.930
I will.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:43.440
My real ability is neither
the cannon nor telepathy.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.480
It's whatever the other person thinks it is.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.570
What in the world?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.620
Hey-ho!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.290
Watch closely, good kids!
And bad ones, too.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:05.290
Your sweet li'l Mion has
a quest for you all!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.840
This here's what we call
an ultra big chance!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:13.050
It's a massive kill quest:
"The Hunt is On! Goo-Goo Ghouls!"

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.550
The game begins tomorrow at 9:00 AM.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.350
The location is the ruins in Block D.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.560
Better get to sleep early to prepare!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.180
See you then!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.850
A quest?

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.940
Is this what our leader was talking about?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.030
We'll dispose of the slaves tomorrow.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.240
Yeah, they're so annoying.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.000
A huge influx of people,
a large-scale quest...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.080
What is Mion thinking?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.840
This is one of Mion's quests.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.760
We can expect to earn a greater
amount of points than usual.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.720
I want everyone with appropriate
abilities to participate.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.560
I've organized you into
teams based on your roles.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.600
I want you all to listen to
your leaders and avoid risk.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:11.110
Akira and Yuuri, you said you wanted
to be together on missions.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:16.200
For your first go-round, I'd like you
to serve as a two-man flying column.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.700
Your abilities will be best
used traveling light.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.490
Yes, sir!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.750
You stayin' in?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.290
Those who want to go have gone.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.540
You want in on it, too?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.210
Nah. That ain't what I'm after anyway.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:35.840
But didn't you say you were
almost out of points, Leader?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.180
Oh... right.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.470
I really did not wanna go out today...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.270
Hey, about last night...

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.690
That weird ability of yours...

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:58.030
You can use any ability
I think you can use, right?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:58.860
Yes.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.580
You haven't forgotten our
agreement from last night?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.660
I hope I can do it, but...

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.080
I'm counting on you, Yuuri.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.420
When I heard that you could use the
interface to look up information,

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:14.130
the first thing I tried was
information about abilities.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:18.800
But I couldn't get any information
about abilities at all.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.550
Which means that the ability ranking
system that Katsuya brought up

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:25.270
is something the players have
come up with themselves.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:31.230
The trouble would come if someone
already knows that my ability exists.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.780
I need to act before someone gets my number,

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.610
and I was going to have to do
it sooner or later anyway.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.990
Yuuri is the ideal "other person"
under my ability's parameters...

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:47.250
Even though telling her is basically
putting my life in her hands.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.130
I had no idea...

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.500
how much harder it is to trust someone else

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.470
than to get them to trust you!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.510
We've arrived.

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.640
These are the Block D ruins.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.600
Akira! Look!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.730
Welcome, all!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:16.070
This is the Mion Presents
Goo-Goo Ghouls party venue!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:20.030
Enjoy it <i>to death</i>, you guys!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.080
Aren't those...

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.750
The quest ends when either all the
ghouls or all the people are dead!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.590
Each ghoul kill earns you thirty points!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.260
And don't forget!
While participating in the quest,

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.970
it's forbidden to attack
other quest participants!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:48.180
Goo-Goo Ghouls... start!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.390
What are those things?!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.610
Stay strong!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.400
All team tanks!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.480
Move forward and ring up!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.200
Binders!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.040
Hold down the enemies the tanks lured in!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.870
Then slayers!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:21.720
While the tanks and binders keep the enemy
distracted, the slayers do their work!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.090
They might be big and tough,
but they move simplistically.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.300
They're nothing to be afraid of.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:43.150
In other words, with both weapons
and intelligence, we'll beat them every time.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.620
Okay! Let's roll!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.620
It's okay, Yuuri.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.620
With your quintuple movement,
you can run circles around them.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.290
Let's execute the agreement
we made last night!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.540
Got it!

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.170
Purge, finish it off!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.680
It's coming!

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.220
Ya sure this is what ya want?

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:08.890
Yes.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.720
Curse doll...

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.570
See?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.110
Scary!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.240
Yuuri! You see Team C's leader's ability?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.160
Yes!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.240
Is that teleportation?

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.920
Just as I thought!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.670
Agreement?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:44.880
Yeah.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.470
First, I want you to keep thinking
that my ability is telepathy.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.430
But then how will you
fight with your cannon?

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.930
It's covered.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:57.730
Everyone else still thinks
my ability is the cannon.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:01.480
So when I want to use the cannon,
I'll just switch to someone else.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.490
Whatever the other person
thinks my ability is...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.990
"The other person" can be anyone who
sees themselves as engaged with me.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.000
"The other person about to shoot me."

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.210
"The other person I'm about to fight."

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:22.420
The question is whether anybody but Yuuri
will be engaged with me out there.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.170
The leader is a cautious person.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:31.140
If the people with rare abilities like ours
want to fight, he'll make full use of us,

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:36.890
but he'll task trusted allies to watch
over us to make sure we're not lost.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.480
They'll always be thinking of me as
"the other person I'm watching out for"!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.900
This will work.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:48.450
I can switch between abilities by having
engagements with multiple people.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:52.240
With Yuuri's help, I can move
my ability to the next stage!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.080
Akira's really going at it.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.290
But I wonder how long he can keep it up...

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.900
Is that Team Red?

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.730
Hey, it's the cannon kid
we've heard so much about!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.110
Just like Mr. Masa said!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.740
Lower your voice before I kill you.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.820
Yeah, right! Sorry!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:30.820
Uh, sorry...

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.530
But sending out a new recruit like that...

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.160
Are the Greens getting desperate?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:40.130
They prioritize point acquisition,
even if it means we see their abilities.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.210
But knowing Shirasagi, I would expect...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.670
I wasn't expecting Kuroiwa to show.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.920
I don't want him watching us!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.930
We should hide our abilities.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.550
Yuuri! Try to limit—

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.550
Huh?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.010
So much for that!

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.520
I set up this whole event,
and you won't even take part,

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.310
Ichi-Kuro Brothers?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.770
Our brain's decision, not mine.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.690
Boo!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.520
Don't pester us, Mion.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.150
You said you'd stay out.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.070
Oh, is someone running away?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.700
And they were doing so well.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.450
Is it because they saw you?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.030
I knew it.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.450
Shirasagi...

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.750
There's something he doesn't want me to see.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.080
We won't let them get away.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.790
That's why we brought all these slaves here.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.800
Please don't do this!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.170
"Don't do this"?

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.130
You all owe me a debt, remember?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.470
It's time you repaid it.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.770
If we leave the ruins now,

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.890
the ghouls' targets will shift to Team Red.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:44.900
And then—

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.780
What are they doing?

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.700
Something's not right.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.360
Can it be...

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.370
They're being forced to charge in?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.330
To slow us down?!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.540
You said quest participants are forbidden
from attacking each other.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.460
But this doesn't violate
the rules, does it, Mion?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.290
Nah! I'll give you this one!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.720
Since I ordered them to attack the
ghouls rather than Team Green.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.720
What now, Shirasagi?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.640
Will you run off and abandon them? Or...

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.180
That girl!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.270
From the second—

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:30.980
Akira!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:31.690
Leader!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.690
Sir?

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:33.400
We have no choice!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.400
Save them!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.820
They're in the palm of our hand.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.370
Like insects.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:42.290
Reminds you of old times, eh, Ichi?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.000
Yeah. Some things don't change,
no matter where you are.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.080
What's your plan now, Mion?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.250
I'm sure you've got more up your sleeve.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:52.050
I was <i>really</i> hoping you'd participate, too.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.630
But this is more interesting,
so I'll allow it.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.020
Ta-dah!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.860
Check out that surprise reveal!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.190
It's Meown, the combined ghoul!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:19.160
How many will survive while
also rescuing the slaves?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.490
Time to start the main event!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.540
Get going.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.500
Ironwall!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.640
Akira!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.480
Leader!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.690
Oh?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.730
Now this is getting interesting.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.190
Akira, can you move?

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.110
I think so.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.530
I'll distract this thing.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.740
When you see an opening, go save Eiji.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.030
Katsuya!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.120
Bring the others together
and get them out of here!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.160
I'll be fine!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.160
The trouble is...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:12.960
Now show me, Shirasagi...
all that your ability encompasses.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.340
Go, Akira!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.510
I said, you're facing me now!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.140
Forced negotiation!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.610
I can't afford to make
the same mistake twice.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:43.570
I used to think that my job upholding
the law was the most important thing...

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.910
Until that day.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:51.500
What would you think if
you saw me now, Ritsuko?

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:56.090
Using it will compromise our
ability to dismantle Team Red...

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:03.140
But I cannot sacrifice the things
that matter to me again!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.770
Negotiation breakdown!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.960
H-He did it!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.790
He took out that monster all by himself!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.090
When I end negotiations,

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.680
I can turn the damage the attacker
dealt back on them to end things.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.350
He'll know my ability's secret now.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.350
He could do that, too?

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.060
I had no idea!

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:55.190
He had an ace in the hole like that, eh?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.690
The sly old dog.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.400
It was worth watching for that.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.280
Excuse me! It's not over yet!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.780
Sir!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.820
We need to get you treated!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.280
I told them to retreat.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.410
Honestly...

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.880
Such a pity!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.090
Our little boss battle isn't over yet.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.470
You <i>do</i> love games, don't you?

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:13.050
Mion and Yang's Next Episode Preview!

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.680
But I don't think I can do a preview
with Mion acting like that.

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:19.810
It could be a horror-themed summer night
episode with ghosts swarming all around!

00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:20.950
Is that why you're wearing that?

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:22.220
You're mocking me!

00:23:22.220 --> 00:23:23.640
But have you ever thought about it?

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:25.140
What if this preview...

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:27.110
were a cursed preview?!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:31.930
Anyone who sees this preview will need to
show it to another person within a week, or else!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:33.000
Or else what?!

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.170
Ghost Mion...

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:35.200
will be sad.

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:37.110
S-See you all next time!

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:38.180
Watch it, everyone!

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:39.470
Or I'll be sad!
